@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Creación de Pago

actor Estudiante as user
participant "Frontend\n(React)" as FE
participant "API Gateway\n(Express)" as API
participant "Payments\nController" as PC
participant "Student\nModel" as SM
participant "Payment\nModel" as PM
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Flujo de Creación de Pago ==

user -> FE: Selecciona monto y adjunta recibo
activate FE

FE -> FE: Calcular almuerzos\n(monto / 2000)
note right: Ejemplo: $10,000 / 2000 = 5

FE -> API: POST /api/payments\n{studentId, amount, comprobantePath}
activate API

API -> PC: createPayment(req, res)
activate PC

PC -> PC: Obtener datos del body\n(studentId, amount, comprobantePath)

PC -> SM: findByPk(studentId)
activate SM
SM -> DB: SELECT * FROM students WHERE id = ?
DB --> SM: Student
SM --> PC: student
deactivate SM

alt Estudiante no existe
  PC --> API: 404 "Estudiante no encontrado"
  API --> FE: 404
  FE --> user: Error
end

PC -> PC: Calcular mealsIncluded\n= Math.floor(amount / 2000)

note right: **Regla de negocio:**\n- $2000 = 1 almuerzo\n- $10000 = 5 almuerzos\n- $4500 = 2 almuerzos (residuo $500)\n- $1999 = 0 almuerzos

PC -> PM: create({...})
activate PM
PM -> DB: INSERT INTO payments
note right: - mealsIncluded calculado\n- mealsUsed = 0\n- isVerified = false
DB --> PM: Payment
PM --> PC: newPayment
deactivate PM

PC --> API: 201 {message, payment, mealsIncluded}
API --> FE: 201 Created

FE --> user: "Pago registrado"\nMuestra: monto, almuerzos incluídos
note right: El pago queda pendiente\nde verificación por admin

deactivate PC
deactivate API
deactivate FE

== Flujo de Verificación de Pago (Admin) ==

actor Admin as admin
participant "Admin\nDashboard" as AD

admin -> AD: Ver pagos pendientes
AD -> API: GET /api/payments?isVerified=false
API --> AD: [Pagos pendientes]

admin -> AD: Click "Verificar" en pago

AD -> API: PATCH /api/payments/:id/verify
activate API

API -> API: authenticate + authorize(ADMIN)
API -> PC: verifyPayment(req, res)
activate PC

PC -> PM: findByPk(id)
activate PM
PM -> DB: SELECT * FROM payments WHERE id = ?
DB --> PM: Payment
PM --> PC: payment
deactivate PM

alt Pago no existe
  PC --> API: 404 "Pago no encontrado"
end

PC -> PM: update({isVerified: true, verifiedBy: adminId})
activate PM
PM -> DB: UPDATE payments SET...
DB --> PM: OK
PM --> PC: OK
deactivate PM

PC --> API: 200 {message, pago verificado}
API --> AD: 200 OK

AD --> admin: "Pago verificado"
note right: El estudiante ya puede\nusar los almuerzos

deactivate PC
deactivate API

@enduml
